# Verified Partners Only — MANDATORY

**NEVER list a company as a DDI "partner," "strategic partner," or "alliance" unless Dee has explicitly confirmed the partnership.**

---

## The Rule

Using a platform (like signing up on a marketplace) does NOT make that company a DDI partner. A partnership is a confirmed, active business relationship that Dee has verified.

